        {
            "id": 6652162,
            "title": "〈台股風向球〉國安基金進場對決外資提款 拚年線上築出大盤底部",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台股上周五經歷史上最黑暗的黑色星期五，造成周跌點多達5510點，跌幅達12%，並跌破40000點整數大關，隨著美股<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費半</a>指數上周五反彈、台積電ADR也止跌彈升6%，市場期待台股出現低檔支撐，本周將看到國安基金上膛對決外資重手出場以及融資減肥的壓力，法人認為較好情形是在年線之上築出大盤底部。</p></section><p></p><div class=\"c1hvmcli\"><figure><div class=\"iirgi4a\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6652162/l/343604f8f3aef8e2b8bbfb4d847c5a38.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\">本周將看到國安基金上膛對決外資重手出場以及融資減肥的壓力。(鉅亨網資料照)</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>上周外資在台股集中市場賣超多達5244億元，同時，外資期貨淨空單達99930口，加上<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/forex/detail/usdtwd\">新台幣</a>匯率一度貶破33元重要大關，尚未看到外資停下從台股重手提款的訊號。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>而外資一周來主要賣超張數前10大標的多為ETF，依序為主動中信台灣收益(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00406A:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00406A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00406A-TW</a>)、元大台灣50(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:0050:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/0050\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">0050-TW</a>)、主動統一台股增長(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00981A:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00981A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00981A-TW</a>)、主動統一升級50(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00403A:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00403A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00403A-TW</a>)、群益台灣精選高息(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00919:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00919\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00919-TW</a>)、主動群益科技創新(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00992A:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00992A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00992A-TW</a>)、力積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6770:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6770\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6770-TW</a>)、台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)、主動國泰動能高息(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:00400A:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/00400A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00400A-TW</a>)和中信台日韓PCB(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:009828:STOCK:ETF\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/009828\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">009828-TW</a>)。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>以金額來看，則是台積電一周來遭外資提款1819億元最多，其次為聯發科(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2454:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2454\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2454-TW</a>)近700億元，元大台灣50達340億元，日月光投控(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3711:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3711\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3711-TW</a>)277億元，欣興(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3037:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3037\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3037-TW</a>)167億元，南亞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1303-TW</a>)逾150億元，台達電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2308:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2308\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2308-TW</a>)也有140億元。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台股交易員提醒，內資方面同樣有壓，儘管投信撐盤，但面對中實戶主力和散戶尚有5341億元的融資餘額，仍不得不提防反彈有壓、下跌又造成融資斷頭。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>不過，台股交易員認為，投資人若無急迫性變現壓力，倒無需過度看壞後市，國安基金已宣布周一進場，此為台股史上第10次護盤，而據統計，過去9次國安基金護盤有8次均為正報酬。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>永豐投顧則指出，台股近期重跌，然融資減肥有限，但此次下跌主因美國民主黨大勝後對AI發展路徑投下變數，不能與過去高槓桿操作失誤等量齊觀，目前市場對AI產業前景急劇反轉有極度恐慌，事態未明，先觀望等待。</p></section><div class=\"ia49rhf\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>永豐投顧認為，先等待融資籌碼變化，若出現大幅減少，行情才能反轉，本周指數區間看38000點至40000點。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>至於AI科技革命，長線目標不變，是短線投資會受到本益比的衝擊。</p></section></main>",
            "link": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6652162",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-08 00:23:34",
